('0671302003', '0671302', 'Sam party dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Sequin', 'White', 'Light', 'Kids Girl Dresses', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Girl', 'Dresses/Skirts girls', 'Sleeveless dress in sequined tulle with a gentle V-neck at the back with concealed press-studs. Seam at the waist and a flared tulle skirt. Fully lined in woven fabric with tulle at the hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
