('0677287001', '0677287', 'Clark slim trs blend', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers woven in a wool blend with a zip fly and concealed hook-and-eye fastening. Side pockets, welt back pockets with a button and legs with creases. Slim fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0677299002', '0677299', 'Mila knitted top', 'Vest top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Orange', 'Dark', 'Knitwear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Knitwear', 'Fitted top in an airy rib knit with a collar, frill-trimmed button placket and short, frill-trimmed sleeves.', NULL, 0, 0),
