('0677304003', '0677304', 'Ylva knitted top', 'Vest top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Light Blue', 'Dusty Light', 'Knitwear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Knitwear', 'Oversized, straight-style top in a fine knit with a collar, V-neck, dropped shoulders, short sleeves with ribbed trims, and a ribbed hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0677321001', '0677321', 'Johnston slim jacquard trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Jacquard', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in a jacquard weave with a sheen. Concealed hook-and-eye fastening, zip fly, side pockets, jetted back pockets and legs with creases front and back. Slim fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
