('0682566001', '0682566', 'SKINNY HEAVY TRASH', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Denim', 'Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Young Boy Denim', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Young Boy', 'Trousers Denim', '5-pocket slim-fit jeans in washed stretch denim with hard-worn details that are patched inside, an adjustable elasticated waist, zip fly and button, and narrow hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682569001', '0682569', 'Miguel slim blazer Robu black', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Blazer', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in marled wool with narrow notch lapels with a decorative buttonhole, one chest pocket, jetted front pockets and three inner pockets, one with a button. Two buttons at the front and decorative buttons at the cuffs. Slim fit that tapers at the chest and waist, which combined with slightly narrower sleeves creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682571003', '0682571', 'CE Sol v-neck sweater', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Pink', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Boxy jumper knitted in soft cashmere with ribbed sections, a V-neck, dropped shoulders and long sleeves. The cashmere content of the jumper is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682572001', '0682572', 'CE Hirst jkt', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Cape in faux fur made from a soft wool blend with concealed press-studs at the front, deep armholes at the sides, a pleat at the back and pleats at the hem. Lined. Made partly from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682573001', '0682573', 'CE Portrait dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Sleeveless dress with a bodice in an organic cotton weave with support panels and decorative seams, and a long, pleated skirt in three layers of Econyl® tulle. Concealed zip in one side. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682576001', '0682576', 'CE Pavillion dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Calf-length dress in patterned organic silk with wide, sewn-on ties at the neckline, and a deep V-neck and concealed zip at the back. Long, tapered sleeves with pleats and covered buttons at the cuffs, a seam at the waist and a skirt with a sewn-in wrapover and high slit at the front. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682580001', '0682580', 'CE Session dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Dress in a Tencel™ lyocell and silk weave containing glittery metal threads. Small stand-up collar with a decorative drawstring at the front, buttons at the top and a concealed zip at the back. Long sleeves with elasticated, flounced cuffs, and pleats at the hem. Recycled polyester lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682581001', '0682581', 'CE Fortuny dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Double-layered dress in airy, patterned chiffon with raw-edge flounces. Pleats around the neckline, pleats at the front, an opening with a button at the top and a concealed zip at the back with a hook-and-eye fastening at the back of the neck. Long sleeves with elastication and raw-edge flounces at the cuffs, decorative seams at the waist and an asymmetric skirt. Unlined. The dress is made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682582001', '0682582', 'CE Twombly mini dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Short dress in twill with a slight sheen. Sewn-in ties at the neck, inset lace trims, a deep V-neck at the back and cap sleeves. Lined. The dress is made partly from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682583001', '0682583', 'CE Artefact dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Sleeveless, jacquard-weave dress in silk and recycled polyester with a deep V-neck front and back, discreet shoulder pads and a concealed zip at the back. Lining in a Tencel™ lyocell blend.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682600001', '0682600', 'Lazy cross bag', 'Bag', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Small Bags', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Big accessories', 'Accessories', 'Shoulder bag in grained imitation leather with a narrow shoulder strap and one inner compartment. Flap with a concealed magnetic fastener and decorative tab with a metal fastener. Lined. Size 6x17.5x20 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682600002', '0682600', 'Lazy cross bag', 'Bag', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Dark Red', 'Dark', 'Small Bags', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Big accessories', 'Accessories', 'Shoulder bag in grained imitation leather with a narrow shoulder strap and one inner compartment. Flap with a concealed magnetic fastener and decorative tab with a metal fastener. Lined. Size 6x17.5x20 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682604001', '0682604', 'SPEED Piper W', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short dress in a crêpe weave with a collar and buttons down the front. Gently dropped shoulders, long sleeves with buttoned cuffs and a rounded hem with high slits in the sides. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0682604002', '0682604', 'SPEED Piper W', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Stripe', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short dress in a crêpe weave with a collar and buttons down the front. Gently dropped shoulders, long sleeves with buttoned cuffs and a rounded hem with high slits in the sides. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
