('0686589001', '0686589', 'GURRA boy set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Melange', 'Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a long-sleeved bodysuit and trousers with braces in soft organic cotton. Bodysuit in ribbed jersey with a button placket and press-studs at the crotch. Trousers in woven fabric with braces that button at the front and elastication at the back of the waist and at the hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0686590001', '0686590', 'CLEO shirtdress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Chambray', 'Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Baby Girl Woven', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Dress in woven cotton with a collar, button placket and a chest pocket. Long sleeves with a tab and button, a gathered yoke at the back and a rounded hem. Detachable imitation suede belt. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0686590003', '0686590', 'CLEO shirtdress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Stripe', 'Blue', 'Medium', 'Baby Girl Woven', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Dress in woven cotton with a collar, button placket and a chest pocket. Long sleeves with a tab and button, a gathered yoke at the back and a rounded hem. Detachable imitation suede belt. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0686592001', '0686592', 'ORVAR set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Front print', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a pair of dungarees and a long-sleeved top in soft organic cotton jersey. Dungarees with concealed press-studs at the crotch, straps with a button on the shoulders,a kangaroo pocket with printed appliqués, and sewn-in turn-ups at the hems. Top with lapped shoulders and long-sleeves.', NULL, 0, 0),
