('0686604001', '0686604', 'Pat ss bd oxford solid', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Turquoise', 'Medium Dusty', 'Shirt', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Contemporary Casual', 'Shirts', 'Short-sleeved shirt in Oxford cotton with a button-down collar and classic front. Yoke with a pleat at the back, an open chest pocket and a rounded hem. Slightly longer at the back. Regular Fit – a classic fit with good room for movement and a gently tapered waist to create a comfortable, tailored silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
