('0688383001', '0688383', 'Jackie body', 'Underwear body', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Functional Lingerie', 'Lingeries/Tights', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Lingerie', 'Under-, Nightwear', 'V-neck, microfibre body with a light shaping effect on the waist and bum. Inset lace sections, narrow adjustable shoulder straps, press-studs at the crotch and laser-cut edges at the top and legs for a smooth silhouette. Lined gusset .', NULL, 0, 0),
