('0694812001', '0694812', 'Twisted pile', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Baby Boy Outdoor', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Boy', 'Outdoor', 'Knitted jacket with a stand-up collar, zip down the front with a chin guard, long raglan sleeves and front pockets. Soft, thermal fleece inside.', NULL, 0, 0),
