('0694814001', '0694814', 'Inter racer jacket', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Jacket Smart', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Mens Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Jacket in imitation leather with a zip down the front and small stand-up collar with a tab and press-stud. Zipped chest pocket, zipped side pockets, a zip at the cuffs and an adjustable tab and press-stud at the sides of the hem. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0694817001', '0694817', 'energy herrington jacket', 'Coat', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Jacket Smart', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Mens Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Jacket woven in a cotton blend with a zip down the front and stand-up collar with buttons. Loose yoke at the back, open side pockets, an inner pocket with a button, and wide elastication at the cuffs and hem. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0694819002', '0694819', 'Brago slim stand alone blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Blazer', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in a marled wool weave with narrow notch lapels, a decorative buttonhole and two buttons at the front. Chest pocket, flap front pockets and three inner pockets, one with a button. Suede elbow patches, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lined. Slim Fit – a fit that tapers at the chest and waist, which combined with slightly narrower sleeves creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0694821002', '0694821', 'Ryan long seersucker blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Blazer', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in dobby-weave wool with narrow notch lapels with a decorative buttonhole. Chest pocket, patch front pockets and two inner pockets, one with a button. Two buttons at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lined. Relaxed fit with good room for movement over the shoulders, chest and waist to create a comfortable, relaxed silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0694823001', '0694823', 'Ryan wide seersucker trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in dobby-weave wool with a concealed button, hook-and-eye fastener and zip fly. Pockets in the side seams, jetted back pockets and legs with creases. Relaxed fit with good room for movement over the thighs and knees to create a comfortable, relaxed silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0694827001', '0694827', 'Manne fleece NB', 'Outdoor overall', 'Garment Full body', 'Melange', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'All-in-one suit in soft, thermal fleece with a pile-lined hood with sewn-on ears. Zip down the front that continues down one leg and has a chin guard at the top, long sleeves and narrow ribbing at the cuffs and hems. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
